## Color and Opacity at a ColorSamples count of 5, bare then bracketed, each followed by
## a Sphere so a mis-counted read desyncs the next parse. Not third-party.
Display "colorcount_5.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
ColorSamples [ 0.125 0.25 0.375 0.5 0.625 0.75 0.875 1 1.125 1.25 1.375 1.5 1.625 1.75 1.875 ] [ 2 2.125 2.25 2.375 2.5 2.625 2.75 2.875 3 3.125 3.25 3.375 3.5 3.625 3.75 ]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Color 3.875 4 4.125 4.25 4.375
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Color [ 4.5 4.625 4.75 4.875 5 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Opacity 5.125 5.25 5.375 5.5 5.625
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Opacity [ 5.75 5.875 6 6.125 6.25 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
